1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:03,450
It's not that I don't want to meet people.

2
00:00:05,650 --> 00:00:07,650
I just don't know how to start.

3
00:00:09,608 --> 00:00:12,758
After I started working, I realized...

4
00:00:12,958 --> 00:00:15,358
Every day brings more new work.

5
00:00:17,208 --> 00:00:18,558
Not new people.

6
00:00:29,033 --> 00:00:30,283
Then I thought...

7
00:00:32,475 --> 00:00:34,825
Maybe I don't need to be someone else.

